1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,375 --> 00:00:37,458
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
New Moon)

3
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:00,750
(Duo Mu)

4
00:01:13,083 --> 00:01:15,642
(Yan Jiu)

5
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,790
=Episode 2=
(The Chief's Escort)

6
00:01:27,666 --> 00:01:30,125
(They say that on this continent,)

7
00:01:30,750 --> 00:01:32,416
(people are divided into ranks.)

8
00:01:38,583 --> 00:01:40,500
(At the very top are the gods.)

9
00:01:41,208 --> 00:01:43,333
(They live in Yuyou Village
atop Mount Buzhou,)

10
00:01:43,916 --> 00:01:45,208
(looking down upon all beings,)

11
00:01:45,583 --> 00:01:46,875
(and living as long as Heaven itself.)

12
00:01:51,333 --> 00:01:53,375
(Below the gods are the Heavenwrights.)

13
00:01:53,916 --> 00:01:55,500
(They come from powerful sects
and clans,)

14
00:01:55,708 --> 00:01:57,250
(wielding the power
of heavenly thunder.)

15
00:01:57,583 --> 00:01:58,958
(They wield Heaven's authority)

16
00:01:59,208 --> 00:02:00,541
(and hold the power of life and death.)

17
00:02:01,875 --> 00:02:03,291
(And the ones who sustain them)

18
00:02:03,583 --> 00:02:04,916
(are the common people.)

19
00:02:05,791 --> 00:02:06,875
(They till the fields,)

20
00:02:06,875 --> 00:02:07,750
(pay their grain taxes,)

21
00:02:07,750 --> 00:02:08,791
(and make offerings,)

22
00:02:09,583 --> 00:02:11,541
(all for Heaven's protection.)

23
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:14,791
(At the very bottom)

24
00:02:14,958 --> 00:02:17,000
(are humans like us,
tainted by monster aura.)

25
00:02:17,666 --> 00:02:20,041
(The world no longer sees us as human.)

26
00:02:20,458 --> 00:02:21,708
(They call us half-monsters.)

27
00:02:23,083 --> 00:02:24,666
(Half-monsters have only two choices.)

28
00:02:25,125 --> 00:02:26,958
(Either live at the bottom
of the Capital)

29
00:02:27,333 --> 00:02:28,625
(as monster slaves for life,)

30
00:02:29,166 --> 00:02:30,208
(never seeing the light of day,)

31
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:32,708
(or live like us,)

32
00:02:33,083 --> 00:02:34,333
(out here in the Monster Wastes,)

33
00:02:34,666 --> 00:02:35,666
(risking our lives)

34
00:02:36,416 --> 00:02:37,416
(on escort runs.)

35
00:02:40,375 --> 00:02:41,166
(This way,)

36
00:02:41,625 --> 00:02:42,458
(at least)

37
00:02:43,125 --> 00:02:44,750
(our lives are in our own hands.)

38
00:02:49,166 --> 00:02:50,083
(But)

39
00:02:50,541 --> 00:02:52,083
(those lives hang by a thread.)

40
00:02:53,208 --> 00:02:54,541
(Every time we head out on a job,)

41
00:02:54,541 --> 00:02:56,041
(whether we make it back alive)

42
00:02:56,458 --> 00:02:57,625
(is up to fate.)

43
00:02:57,625 --> 00:02:58,625
(Redtail Armed Escort Agency)

44
00:02:59,416 --> 00:03:00,666
(The Chief's cargo)

45
00:03:01,166 --> 00:03:02,083
(is gone.)

46
00:03:02,208 --> 00:03:04,291
The Chief's presence was last detected

47
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:05,458
just ahead.

48
00:03:11,666 --> 00:03:12,458
Yan.

49
00:03:12,458 --> 00:03:14,125
It's one of ours.

50
00:03:18,041 --> 00:03:18,833
It's Ying San.

51
00:03:21,791 --> 00:03:22,583
Vermilion marrow fruit?

52
00:03:24,208 --> 00:03:25,583
It grows on vermilion marrow trees
in the Southern Region

53
00:03:25,625 --> 00:03:26,500
and ripens only once
every hundred years.

54
00:03:26,583 --> 00:03:27,708
Its sweet scent can lure

55
00:03:27,708 --> 00:03:29,208
all monsters and beasts
for miles around.

56
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,083
Yan.

57
00:03:30,166 --> 00:03:31,041
His consciousness is still intact.

58
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,041
Guard my body.

59
00:03:33,083 --> 00:03:33,916
I'm going in.

60
00:03:43,583 --> 00:03:45,415
(Redtail Armed Escort Agency)

61
00:03:45,416 --> 00:03:46,291
I need an escort.

62
00:03:46,791 --> 00:03:47,916
We're closed for the day.

63
00:03:48,250 --> 00:03:49,500
We can't go pick up your cargo.

64
00:03:49,916 --> 00:03:51,375
Bring it here tomorrow.

65
00:03:51,708 --> 00:03:52,791
I'm the cargo.

66
00:03:54,625 --> 00:03:56,041
Take me

67
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,458
to the Capital.

68
00:04:01,208 --> 00:04:02,333
We run an armed escort agency

69
00:04:02,791 --> 00:04:04,041
to do business.

70
00:04:08,875 --> 00:04:10,208
How much can you pay?

71
00:04:12,791 --> 00:04:14,083
My life.

72
00:04:14,166 --> 00:04:15,416
It's yours.

73
00:04:17,958 --> 00:04:19,125
What's your name?

74
00:04:20,458 --> 00:04:21,541
Lu Yuanqing.

75
00:04:58,791 --> 00:05:00,916
The scent of those
vermilion marrow fruits

76
00:05:01,083 --> 00:05:02,958
drew in the ravenous Gudiao and Zhuhuai.

77
00:05:02,958 --> 00:05:03,666
Where's the Chief?

78
00:05:04,125 --> 00:05:05,125
I don't know.

79
00:05:07,750 --> 00:05:08,541
It's a Gudiao!

80
00:05:38,250 --> 00:05:39,333
Yan, look!

81
00:06:03,583 --> 00:06:05,166
Redtail Armed Escort Agency!

82
00:06:06,083 --> 00:06:07,458
A promise across a thousand miles!

83
00:06:08,708 --> 00:06:10,291
Through life and death, we never fail!

84
00:06:11,208 --> 00:06:13,541
Bring our brothers home!

85
00:06:14,875 --> 00:06:16,333
Rise!

86
00:06:25,167 --> 00:06:29,433
(Redtail Armed Escort Agency)

87
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,000
(Redtail; A Promise Across a
Thousand Miles; Through Life and Death)

88
00:06:35,458 --> 00:06:37,208
I don't know what the Chief
was thinking,

89
00:06:37,208 --> 00:06:38,041
taking this job.

90
00:06:38,041 --> 00:06:39,583
It cost us six brothers!

91
00:06:39,583 --> 00:06:40,250
Yeah.

92
00:06:40,791 --> 00:06:42,208
Who's this guy?

93
00:06:42,208 --> 00:06:43,416
What's he doing in this shipment?

94
00:06:43,791 --> 00:06:45,291
He showed up yesterday

95
00:06:45,291 --> 00:06:47,125
and asked us to escort him
to Yuyou Village.

96
00:06:47,416 --> 00:06:48,458
(Yuyou Village?)

97
00:06:48,958 --> 00:06:51,416
The Chief added him to this run,

98
00:06:51,541 --> 00:06:53,208
gave him a Breath-Suppressing Pill,

99
00:06:53,208 --> 00:06:54,916
and personally guarded him
the whole way.

100
00:06:55,250 --> 00:06:57,291
That's how he escaped the monsters
and beasts.

101
00:07:02,583 --> 00:07:03,916
Contractor: Lu Yuanqing.

102
00:07:04,541 --> 00:07:06,000
(Escort Contract)
Voluntarily offers myself as cargo,

103
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,291
entrusting Redtail Armed Escort Agency
to deliver me to Yuyou Village.

104
00:07:08,541 --> 00:07:09,375
Escort fee:

105
00:07:09,916 --> 00:07:11,333
the life of Lu Yuanqing!

106
00:07:16,292 --> 00:07:17,750
(When Heaven is unjust,
we must save ourselves.)

107
00:07:24,416 --> 00:07:26,583
The escort failed, and my cargo is gone.

108
00:07:26,583 --> 00:07:28,458
Is everyone at Redtail
completely useless?

109
00:07:28,708 --> 00:07:30,041
For your shipment,

110
00:07:30,250 --> 00:07:31,500
we lost six of our brothers,

111
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:34,208
and our Chief is still missing.

112
00:07:35,416 --> 00:07:36,541
Six half-monsters?

113
00:07:36,541 --> 00:07:37,875
So what if they're dead?

114
00:07:37,875 --> 00:07:39,416
I want an answer!

115
00:07:39,916 --> 00:07:40,541
My cargo.

116
00:07:40,916 --> 00:07:41,500
Where is it?

117
00:07:41,875 --> 00:07:43,666
You put vermilion marrow fruits
in the cargo.

118
00:07:44,500 --> 00:07:46,500
Their sweet scent carries for miles.

119
00:07:46,750 --> 00:07:48,541
It drew in the Gudiao and Zhuhuai.

120
00:07:48,666 --> 00:07:50,625
If you'd told us they were
in the shipment,

121
00:07:50,625 --> 00:07:53,666
we never would've taken the job!

122
00:07:53,916 --> 00:07:57,416
The fruits were ordered by Lord Wang of
the Heavenly Law Bureau in the Capital.

123
00:07:57,666 --> 00:07:59,500
If Lord Wang wants them fresh,

124
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:02,166
then even if every last one
of you at Redtail dies,

125
00:08:02,291 --> 00:08:03,083
you'll deliver them!

126
00:08:06,541 --> 00:08:07,875
They have the Heavenly Law Bureau
behind them.

127
00:08:08,666 --> 00:08:09,916
With the Chief gone,

128
00:08:10,208 --> 00:08:11,666
we have to hold the agency together
for her.

129
00:08:11,958 --> 00:08:12,625
Scared?

130
00:08:13,541 --> 00:08:14,416
You should be.

131
00:08:15,083 --> 00:08:16,500
Know your place.

132
00:08:16,666 --> 00:08:17,875
You're half-monsters,

133
00:08:18,291 --> 00:08:19,833
an inferior breed.

134
00:08:22,625 --> 00:08:23,666
The cargo is gone.

135
00:08:24,208 --> 00:08:25,291
And we lost our brothers.

136
00:08:25,416 --> 00:08:26,958
If you want compensation,

137
00:08:27,375 --> 00:08:28,291
name your price.

138
00:08:29,416 --> 00:08:30,333
Fine.

139
00:08:30,666 --> 00:08:33,208
Then give me the whole agency.

140
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:36,125
But from what I can see,

141
00:08:36,625 --> 00:08:38,708
this place is useless anyway.

142
00:08:41,958 --> 00:08:43,708
Tear Redtail

143
00:08:43,833 --> 00:08:44,833
to the ground!

144
00:08:48,125 --> 00:08:50,000
I dare you!

145
00:09:14,166 --> 00:09:15,000
Who's this?

146
00:09:15,875 --> 00:09:17,583
Redtail took my job

147
00:09:17,916 --> 00:09:19,166
to escort me to Yuyou Village.

148
00:09:19,958 --> 00:09:20,750
This escort

149
00:09:21,250 --> 00:09:22,208
isn't over yet.

150
00:09:22,416 --> 00:09:23,708
Yuyou Village?

151
00:09:24,250 --> 00:09:25,041
Boy,

152
00:09:25,791 --> 00:09:27,458
do you even know what that place is?

153
00:09:27,791 --> 00:09:29,458
Yuyou Village is the home of the gods.

154
00:09:29,666 --> 00:09:32,250
Even we Heavenwrights
aren't allowed anywhere near it.

155
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:33,083
And you?

156
00:09:33,625 --> 00:09:35,208
A mere mortal,

157
00:09:35,666 --> 00:09:37,708
dreaming of reaching Yuyou Village?

158
00:09:39,083 --> 00:09:40,291
What makes you think you can?

159
00:09:43,666 --> 00:09:45,166
This blade.

160
00:09:51,458 --> 00:09:52,916
Just a stupid kid

161
00:09:53,083 --> 00:09:54,125
with a little knife.

162
00:09:54,333 --> 00:09:56,791
Are you stupid or insane?

163
00:09:56,833 --> 00:09:58,250
Bro, I'll teach him a lesson.

164
00:10:40,958 --> 00:10:42,375
Come at me.

165
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:26,916
Come on!

166
00:11:53,583 --> 00:11:57,083
(Yin and yang share one source.
They oppose yet sustain each other.)

167
00:11:57,208 --> 00:12:00,916
(Heavenly thunder and monster aura
also spring from the same source.)

168
00:12:01,333 --> 00:12:02,666
(As long as you don't fear it,)

169
00:12:02,916 --> 00:12:04,500
(it can't hurt you.)

170
00:12:05,041 --> 00:12:06,291
(As long as you don't fear it,)

171
00:12:06,916 --> 00:12:09,333
(you can make it your own.)

172
00:12:16,041 --> 00:12:18,000
(Turbid Dragon. First Strike!)

173
00:12:18,583 --> 00:12:20,958
(Skybreaker!)

174
00:12:24,666 --> 00:12:25,541
Impossible!

175
00:12:25,708 --> 00:12:27,083
How can an inferior breed

176
00:12:27,333 --> 00:12:29,041
wield heavenly thunder?

177
00:12:29,166 --> 00:12:29,875
No way!

178
00:12:29,875 --> 00:12:31,916
No one is born above
or below anyone else.

179
00:12:32,791 --> 00:12:34,666
And heavenly thunder is nothing special.

180
00:12:35,166 --> 00:12:35,500
Get lost!

181
00:12:46,083 --> 00:12:46,708
Hey.

182
00:12:46,791 --> 00:12:48,166
I'm Redtail's Second Chief,

183
00:12:48,291 --> 00:12:48,791
Yan Jiu.

184
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,208
What are you going to Yuyou Village for?

185
00:13:02,375 --> 00:13:04,333
Those jerks took my sister.

186
00:13:04,791 --> 00:13:06,208
I'm going to destroy the Eye of Heaven

187
00:13:06,208 --> 00:13:07,333
and save her.

188
00:13:10,291 --> 00:13:11,291
My contract...

189
00:13:11,583 --> 00:13:12,666
does it still stand?

190
00:13:15,833 --> 00:13:17,166
At Redtail,

191
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:19,375
we never abandon an escort halfway.

192
00:13:19,375 --> 00:13:20,458
♪A good dream nearly came true♪
(Redtail)

193
00:13:21,583 --> 00:13:25,000
♪I believe in the absurdity here♪

194
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:29,000
♪It blows you to pieces
deep in my heart♪

195
00:13:29,333 --> 00:13:29,916
Hey.

196
00:13:30,291 --> 00:13:32,500
How did you convince our chief
to take your job?

197
00:13:32,500 --> 00:13:34,500
♪The wind sounds so sweet
it nears unreality♪

198
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:35,375
Actually,

199
00:13:35,833 --> 00:13:37,958
I'd already tried three other
armed escort agencies.

200
00:13:38,458 --> 00:13:40,291
They all laughed and called me crazy.

201
00:13:41,166 --> 00:13:42,250
Then I heard

202
00:13:42,375 --> 00:13:43,708
Redtail was the only agency

203
00:13:43,791 --> 00:13:45,208
willing to cross the Monster Wastes.

204
00:13:46,375 --> 00:13:50,000
♪The doubtful eyes of others♪

205
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,875
I was very sick as a child.

206
00:13:52,458 --> 00:13:53,791
Nothing could cure me.

207
00:13:54,708 --> 00:13:56,750
Then my parents found
a special ingredient,

208
00:13:57,583 --> 00:13:58,625
and I recovered.

209
00:14:00,208 --> 00:14:01,708
Only when I grew up did I learn

210
00:14:02,250 --> 00:14:03,250
that the ingredient

211
00:14:03,958 --> 00:14:06,375
was made from the heart's blood
of a half-monster child.

212
00:14:07,958 --> 00:14:09,083
I lived.

213
00:14:09,833 --> 00:14:11,416
That child

214
00:14:12,583 --> 00:14:13,333
died.

215
00:14:15,125 --> 00:14:17,791
No one asked if that child's
parents agreed.

216
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,916
No one asked the child either.

217
00:14:21,625 --> 00:14:22,541
They didn't even

218
00:14:23,125 --> 00:14:24,833
ask me

219
00:14:24,833 --> 00:14:26,000
if I wanted it.

220
00:14:26,692 --> 00:14:28,567
♪I was born in midair♪

221
00:14:28,867 --> 00:14:32,208
♪How will you go on♪

222
00:14:33,708 --> 00:14:35,375
♪With the infinity of the universe♪

223
00:14:36,375 --> 00:14:37,516
Redtail Armed Escort Agency

224
00:14:38,416 --> 00:14:40,291
wasn't founded for business.

225
00:14:41,041 --> 00:14:42,375
Then what was it founded for?

226
00:14:42,375 --> 00:14:43,875
To make sure every child in this world

227
00:14:44,250 --> 00:14:45,416
can take their own fate

228
00:14:45,416 --> 00:14:47,041
into their own hands.

229
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:54,666
Eat up.

230
00:14:55,708 --> 00:14:56,583
Once we're on the road,

231
00:14:56,583 --> 00:14:58,166
there won't be any oranges.

232
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:08,270
(Escort Contract: Lu Yuanqing)

233
00:15:11,300 --> 00:15:14,542
♪The heavens are dark♪

234
00:15:14,543 --> 00:15:17,458
♪The moon shines bright♪

235
00:15:18,125 --> 00:15:21,366
Take me
to Yuyou Village in the Capital...

236
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
to slay the gods.

237
00:15:27,708 --> 00:15:28,875
What's your name?

238
00:15:28,892 --> 00:15:31,708
♪It is not my wish♪

239
00:15:33,333 --> 00:15:34,208
Lu Yuanqing.

240
00:15:39,350 --> 00:15:42,458
♪The doubtful eyes of others♪

241
00:15:42,458 --> 00:15:43,625
Redtail Armed Escort Agency.

242
00:15:44,125 --> 00:15:45,416
I, Le Wei, accept this commission.

243
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,291
The escort fee has been paid in full.

244
00:15:48,208 --> 00:15:50,666
I shall personally escort the cargo
to Yuyou Village.

245
00:15:50,666 --> 00:15:52,291
Should anything happen
to me along the way,

246
00:15:52,291 --> 00:15:53,416
the entire agency

247
00:15:53,416 --> 00:15:54,458
shall carry on my mission...

248
00:15:54,458 --> 00:15:55,541
for as many generations as it takes,

249
00:15:55,791 --> 00:15:56,875
until the cargo is delivered.

250
00:15:57,250 --> 00:15:58,291
Words alone are no proof.

251
00:15:58,583 --> 00:15:59,708
Let this contract stand as proof.

252
00:15:59,708 --> 00:16:00,708
(Redtail)

253
00:16:01,083 --> 00:16:02,875
Yan, on the back of the contract,

254
00:16:03,375 --> 00:16:04,791
what did the Chief write?

255
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:10,792
♪Where will you go♪

256
00:16:10,916 --> 00:16:12,041
(When Heaven is unjust,)

257
00:16:12,291 --> 00:16:13,833
(we must save ourselves.)

258
00:16:13,833 --> 00:16:15,166
(Only by standing together)

259
00:16:15,750 --> 00:16:18,208
(can we fight for the light of dawn.)

260
00:16:19,375 --> 00:16:21,500
♪I was born in midair♪

261
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:25,375
♪How will you go on♪

262
00:16:25,916 --> 00:16:27,125
(On this continent,)

263
00:16:27,541 --> 00:16:28,958
(one day,)

264
00:16:28,958 --> 00:16:31,833
(no one will be born above
or below another.)

265
00:16:31,833 --> 00:16:35,375
(We are like shattered jade.)

266
00:16:35,775 --> 00:16:40,208
♪Where will you go♪

267
00:16:41,042 --> 00:16:42,458
♪In the storm♪

268
00:16:42,458 --> 00:16:46,208
♪You must cry out that line♪

269
00:16:47,625 --> 00:16:49,800
♪I was born in midair♪

270
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:53,625
♪How will you go on♪

271
00:16:54,792 --> 00:16:56,650
♪With the infinity of the universe♪

272
00:16:56,892 --> 00:16:59,483
♪But this night is long♪

273
00:17:00,617 --> 00:17:03,000
♪This night is long♪

274
00:17:03,867 --> 00:17:06,475
♪The sky is bright♪

275
00:17:07,633 --> 00:17:10,000
♪The wilderness is vast♪

276
00:17:11,075 --> 00:17:13,792
♪But this night is long♪
